{"name": "Essentials Finder", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Essentials Finder — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>Essentials Finder</title>\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"dbceaeade6\";color-scheme:light dark; --h:356;\n  --bg:var(--myllm-bg,#f2f2f7); --surface:var(--myllm-surface,#fff); --ink:var(--myllm-text,#111);\n  --muted:var(--myllm-muted,#8a8a8e); --line:var(--myllm-border,#e3e3e8); --acc:var(--myllm-accent,#0a84ff);\n  --fill:rgba(120,120,128,.12); }\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){ :root{ --bg:var(--myllm-bg,#000); --surface:var(--myllm-surface,#1c1c1e);\n  --ink:var(--myllm-text,#f2f2f7); --muted:var(--myllm-muted,#8e8e93); --line:var(--myllm-border,#2c2c2e); --fill:rgba(120,120,128,.24); } }\n  *{ margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent; }\n  body{ font-family:var(--myllm-font,-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif); background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);\n    max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; min-height:100dvh; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.4;\n    padding:calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(30px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-left)); }\n  @media (min-width:768px){ body{ max-width:760px; } }\n  svg.i{ width:1.25em; height:1.25em; fill:currentColor; flex-shrink:0; }\n  button{ font:inherit; color:inherit; cursor:pointer; } button:active{ transform:scale(.96); }\n  a{ color:inherit; }\n\n  .head{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin:2px 2px 14px; }\n  .tile{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; flex-shrink:0;\n    background:linear-gradient(145deg, hsl(var(--h) 62% 50%), hsl(calc(var(--h) + 40) 58% 28%)); }\n  .head .tile{ width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:13px; font-size:19px; }\n  .head .ht{ flex:1; min-width:0; }\n  h1{ font-size:22px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.01em; }\n  .head p{ font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:1px; }\n  .head .acts{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-shrink:0; }\n  .head .acts button{ min-width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--surface);\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px; padding:0 10px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:650; }\n  h2{ font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin:20px 2px 10px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }\n\n  .card{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:12px; }\n  label{ display:block; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); margin:14px 2px 7px; }\n  label:first-child{ margin-top:0; }\n  input{ width:100%; font:inherit; font-size:16px; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); outline:none; }\n  input:focus{ border-color:var(--acc); }\n  .field{ position:relative; } .field svg.i{ position:absolute; left:12px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; pointer-events:none; }\n  .field input{ padding-left:38px; }\n  .inrow{ display:flex; gap:8px; } .inrow input{ flex:1; min-width:0; }\n  .chips{ display:flex; gap:7px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; scrollbar-width:none; margin:10px -14px 0; padding:0 14px 2px; }\n  .chips::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }\n  .chip{ flex:0 0 auto; min-height:36px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg); border-radius:99px; padding:0 14px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:650; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .chip.hot{ background:var(--acc); border-color:var(--acc); color:#fff; }\n  .go{ min-height:48px; border:none; border-radius:14px; background:var(--acc); color:#fff; font-size:16px; font-weight:700;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; padding:0 18px; }\n  .go.wide{ width:100%; margin-top:14px; }\n  .go.soft{ background:var(--fill); color:var(--acc); }\n  .go:disabled{ opacity:.55; }\n  .pillbtn{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; min-height:36px; border:none; border-radius:10px; padding:0 12px;\n    background:hsl(var(--h) 70% 50% / .13); color:hsl(var(--h) 70% 38%); font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){ .pillbtn{ color:hsl(var(--h) 80% 70%); } }\n  .spin{ width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; border:2.4px solid currentColor; border-right-color:transparent; animation:spin .8s linear infinite; flex-shrink:0; }\n  @keyframes spin{ to{ transform:rotate(360deg); } }\n  .skel{ border-radius:16px; margin-bottom:10px; background:var(--fill); animation:shimmer 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes shimmer{ 50%{ opacity:.45; } }\n\n  .notice{ display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:14px; margin-bottom:12px; }\n  .notice .tile{ width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:10px; font-size:16px; }\n  .notice.warn .tile{ background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ff9f0a,#c25e00); }\n  .notice b{ display:block; font-size:15px; font-weight:750; }\n  .notice p{ font-size:13.5px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.45; margin-top:2px; }\n  .notice p b{ display:inline; font-size:inherit; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); }\n  .notice .go{ margin-top:10px; min-height:40px; font-size:14.5px; border-radius:12px; }\n  .hint{ text-align:center; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; padding:18px 12px 6px; }\n\n  [hidden]{ display:none !important; }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .spin{ animation-duration:2.4s; } .skel{ animation:none; } button:active{ transform:none; } }\n\n  .grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:9px; margin-bottom:6px; }\n  @media (min-width:600px){ .grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); } }\n  .kind{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:8px; min-height:96px; padding:13px 6px 11px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--surface);\n    border-radius:16px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; text-align:center; line-height:1.2; }\n  .kind .tile{ width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:12px; font-size:18px; }\n  .kind.on{ border-color:hsl(var(--kh) 60% 48%); box-shadow:0 0 0 2px hsl(var(--kh) 60% 48%) inset; }\n  .res{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:12px 13px; margin-bottom:9px; }\n  .res.first{ border-color:hsl(var(--kh,356) 60% 48%); box-shadow:0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--kh,356) 60% 48%) inset; }\n  .res .top{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }\n  .res .name{ flex:1; min-width:0; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.3; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }\n  .res .d{ font-size:12.5px; font-weight:800; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .res .near{ font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#fff; background:hsl(var(--kh,356) 60% 45%); border-radius:99px; padding:3px 8px; }\n  .res .addr{ font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin:3px 0 10px; }\n  .res .pillbtn{ --h:var(--kh,356); }\n</style></head><body>\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs>\n  <symbol id=\"i-kit\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 3.5h6A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 16.5 5v1.5H19A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 21.5 9v9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5H5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 18V9A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 6.5h2.5V5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9 3.5zm.5 2v1h5v-1zM11 10v2.5H8.5v2H11V17h2v-2.5h2.5v-2H13V10z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-pharmacy\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><g transform=\"rotate(-45 12 12)\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"8\" width=\"18\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 8h5v8H7a4 4 0 0 1 0-8z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></g></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-atm\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"6\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-hospital\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9.5 3h5v6.5H21v5h-6.5V21h-5v-6.5H3v-5h6.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-petrol\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6.5 3h7A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 15 4.5V20H5zM7 5.5v4h6v-4z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/><path d=\"M15 9h1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5 1.5v6a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 0V8l-2.5-2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M3.5 20.5h13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-ev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M13.5 2.5L5 13.5h6l-1.5 8 8.5-11h-6z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-supermarket\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 4h2.2l2.2 10.2a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.2h8.3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.1L20.5 8H6.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-police\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l8 3v6c0 5-3.4 8.7-8 10-4.6-1.3-8-5-8-10v-6z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5l1.2 2.5 2.7.3-2 1.9.5 2.7-2.4-1.3-2.4 1.3.5-2.7-2-1.9 2.7-.3z\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,.28)\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-toilets\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"4.8\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"4.8\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M5.5 8.5h4l.8 6H9v6H6v-6H4.7zM14.8 8.5h3.4l2.3 7.5h-2v4.5h-4V16h-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 3v18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\".5\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"k-hotel\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 6v13M3 14h18v5M21 14v-2.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 17.5 8H11v6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-dir\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M11.3 2.7a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0l8.6 8.6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.4l-8.6 8.6a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 0l-8.6-8.6a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4zM13 8.5v2.2H9.5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1V15h2v-2.3H13v2.2l3.2-3.2z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"/></symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"i-warn\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9a2 2 0 0 1 3.4 0l8 13.6a2 2 0 0 1-1.7 3H4a2 2 0 0 1-1.7-3zM12 9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm0 7.2a1.2 1.2 0 1 0 0 2.4 1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-2.4z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></symbol>\n</defs></svg>\n\n<div class=\"head\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#i-kit\"/></svg></div>\n  <div class=\"ht\"><h1>Essentials Finder</h1><p id=\"here\">Finding your location…</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n<div id=\"results\"></div>\n\n<script>\nfunction el(id){return document.getElementById(id)}\n/* Bridges are looked up when used, never kept: MyLLM can add them after this\n   script has run. */\nfunction LOC(){ return window.myllmLocation || null; }\nfunction haptic(k){ if(window.myllmHaptic){ try{ myllmHaptic(k); }catch(_){} } }\nfunction esc(s){ return String(s).replace(/&/g,\"&amp;\").replace(/</g,\"&lt;\").replace(/>/g,\"&gt;\").replace(/\"/g,\"&quot;\"); }\nfunction icon(n){ return '<svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#i-' + n + '\"/></svg>'; }\nvar here = null;\nvar KINDS = [\n  {id:\"pharmacy\",    label:\"Pharmacy\",    q:\"pharmacy\",            h:150},\n  {id:\"atm\",         label:\"ATM\",         q:\"atm\",                 h:210},\n  {id:\"hospital\",    label:\"Hospital\",    q:\"hospital\",            h:356},\n  {id:\"petrol\",      label:\"Petrol\",      q:\"petrol station\",      h:30},\n  {id:\"ev\",          label:\"EV Charger\",  q:\"ev charging station\", h:172},\n  {id:\"supermarket\", label:\"Supermarket\", q:\"supermarket\",         h:96},\n  {id:\"police\",      label:\"Police\",      q:\"police station\",      h:226},\n  {id:\"toilets\",     label:\"Toilets\",     q:\"public toilet\",       h:262},\n  {id:\"hotel\",       label:\"Hotel\",       q:\"hotel\",               h:318}\n];\n\nfunction dist(m){\n  if(m==null) return \"\";\n  if(m<1000) return Math.round(m)+\" m\";\n  return (m/1000).toFixed(m<10000?1:0)+\" km\";\n}\nfunction notice(kind, title, text){\n  el(\"results\").innerHTML='<div class=\"notice'+(kind===\"warn\"?\" warn\":\"\")+'\"><div class=\"tile\">'+icon(kind===\"warn\"?\"warn\":\"kit\")+'</div>'+\n    '<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><b>'+esc(title)+'</b><p>'+text+'</p></div></div>';\n}\n\nfunction tiles(){\n  var g=el(\"grid\");\n  KINDS.forEach(function(k){\n    var b=document.createElement(\"button\");b.type=\"button\";b.className=\"kind\";b.style.setProperty(\"--kh\",k.h);\n    b.innerHTML='<span class=\"tile\" style=\"--h:'+k.h+'\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#k-'+k.id+'\"/></svg></span>'+k.label;\n    b.onclick=function(){\n      haptic(\"selection\");\n      [].forEach.call(g.children,function(c){c.classList.remove(\"on\")});\n      b.classList.add(\"on\");\n      find(k);\n    };\n    g.appendChild(b);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction find(k){\n  var loc=LOC();\n  if(!loc) return;\n  var R=el(\"results\");R.style.setProperty(\"--kh\",k.h);\n  R.innerHTML='<h2>Nearest '+esc(k.label.toLowerCase())+'</h2><div class=\"skel\" style=\"height:104px\"></div><div class=\"skel\" style=\"height:86px\"></div><div class=\"skel\" style=\"height:86px\"></div>';\n  loc.search(k.q,{limit:5}).then(function(list){\n    list=(list||[]).sort(function(a,b){return (a.distance||1e12)-(b.distance||1e12)});\n    if(!list.length){notice(\"warn\",\"Nothing found nearby\",\"No \"+esc(k.label.toLowerCase())+\" turned up around you.\");return}\n    R.innerHTML='<h2>Nearest '+esc(k.label.toLowerCase())+'</h2>';\n    list.forEach(function(p,i){\n      var d=document.createElement(\"div\");d.className=\"res\"+(i===0?\" first\":\"\");\n      var dest=p.latitude+\",\"+p.longitude;\n      d.innerHTML='<div class=\"top\"><div class=\"name\"></div>'+(i===0?'<span class=\"near\">Nearest</span>':'')+'<div class=\"d\">'+dist(p.distance)+'</div></div>'+\n        '<div class=\"addr\"></div>'+\n        '<a class=\"pillbtn\" href=\"https://maps.apple.com/?daddr='+dest+'\">'+icon(\"dir\")+'Directions</a>';\n      d.querySelector(\".name\").textContent=p.name;\n      d.querySelector(\".addr\").textContent=p.address||\"\";\n      R.appendChild(d);\n    });\n    haptic(\"light\");\n  }).catch(function(e){\n    notice(\"warn\",\"Search didn’t work\",esc(e&&e.message?e.message:\"Search failed\")+\" — try again in a moment.\");\n  });\n}\n\nfunction start(){\n  tiles();\n  var loc=LOC();\n  if(!loc){\n    el(\"here\").textContent=\"Location unavailable\";\n    notice(\"warn\",\"Location is off\",'This needs the latest MyLLM with <b>Settings → Allow apps to use your location</b> turned on.');\n    return;\n  }\n  el(\"results\").innerHTML='<p class=\"hint\">Tap what you need — it finds the nearest, with directions.</p>';\n  loc.current().then(function(p){\n    here=p;\n    el(\"here\").textContent=p.address?(\"Near \"+p.address):\"Got your location\";\n  }).catch(function(e){\n    el(\"here\").textContent=\"Location off\";\n    notice(\"warn\",\"Couldn’t get your location\",esc(e&&e.message?e.message:\"Location isn’t available\")+'<br>Turn on <b>Settings → Allow apps to use your location</b>, then reopen.');\n  });\n}\nstart();\n</script></body></html>\n"}